    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/97/Hsien-Ko_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241114132643\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"4 00px\"><img alt=\"4 00px\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/97/Hsien-Ko_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241114132643\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"711\" height=\"1080\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hsien-Ko .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hsien-Ko_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>幽灵少女</b>\n</p><p>一个变成暗夜猎手的人类女孩。她使用名为「异形转身」的禁忌技巧抛弃了人性，以拯救被困在黑暗中的母亲的灵魂。她的妹妹美玲是她僵尸帽中的符纸，用于控制她的力量。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Hsien-ko_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:80px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Hsien-ko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Hsien-ko Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (291 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:80px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/0e/Hsien-ko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20241114132645\" title=\"Hsien-ko Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (291 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hsien-ko Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hsien-ko_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimi